@startuml FIG-CL-TAV-02
skinparam shadowing false
title FIG-CL-TAV-02 Requirement layers and representative trace\nSysML 1.6 notation-based views; executable/metamodel conformance is not claimed\nmethod goals, protocol CRS and tool requirements stay distinct

package "Method goals" as MG {
  [CL-RQ1 loop consistency]
  [CL-RQ2 comparative effect]
  [CL-RQ3 uncertainty and stopping]
}

package "Protocol CRS" as PCRS {
  [INFORMATION]
  [UPLOAD]
  [Media Defined DOWNLOAD]
  [Operator Defined DOWNLOAD]
  [FIND]
  [abort / reject / exception / retry]
}

package "Tool requirements" as TR {
  [later development-ready PR]
  [not this increment]
}

MG ..> PCRS : method uses protocol obligations
PCRS ..> TR : tool may later implement

package "Representative trace E1 subset" as TRACE {
  [SU-ARINC-615A-3-SECTION-6-3-2-SEQUENCE-CHART-A-E007-7726A816FFE7] as SRC
  [CRS-M1-00365] as CRS365
  [CRS-M1-00366] as CRS366
  [CRS-M1-00367] as CRS367
  [constraint: LUR write order] as CON
  [Test / Analysis planned VC] as TA
  [tool module later PR] as TOOL
  [Evidence not executed] as EV
}

SRC --> CRS365 : source unit to requirement
CRS365 --> CRS366
CRS366 --> CRS367
CRS367 --> CON
CON --> TA
TA ..> TOOL : planned
TOOL ..> EV : planned; satisfy/verify are model relations,\nnot executed verification
note bottom of TRACE
  Real bound-M1 IDs. DOWNLOAD/FIND traces wait for source-unit audit.
  No executed verify is claimed.
end note
@enduml
